stages.sampleAnswer:
POST /posts
  body: { text, authorId }
  → 201 { id, text, authorId, timestamp, likeCount }

GET /search?keyword=X&sort_by=recency&page=1&limit=10
  → 200 { posts: [{ id, text, authorId, timestamp, likeCount }, ...], total, page, pages }

POST /posts/:id/like
  body: {}
  → 200 { id, likeCount }
